作者：Aditya Agarwal 账号：@adityaag 简介：General Partner @SPC, Co-Founder @Bevel_Health | Ex: Early Eng @facebook, CTO @Dropbox, Board @Flipkart | Optimist, Builder, Dad
Robotics is going through the same shift LLMs did: from fine-tuning, to prompting, to just telling the model what you want.
@svlevine talked about how π0.7 learns new skills from plain-language coaching. https://t.co/bBgSW0EwCA
